--TEST--
go-to-definition on one segment of a `propertyPath<T>` literal answers the declaration of the property that segment names, on the class the path reached there — `rule:ide/a-field-path-completes-one-segment-at-a-time`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Customer {
    public string $name = "Ada";
}
class Order {
    public ?Customer $customer = null;
}

echo "customer.na<|>me" as propertyPath<Order>;
--REQUEST--
definition
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:3:19
